{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-device-sync-conditional-config","title":"跨设备同步与条件配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/dotfiles-management/cross-device-sync-conditional-config","wordCount":996,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨设备同步与条件配置\">跨设备同步与条件配置</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>开发者通常在多台设备间切换工作——公司 MacBook、个人台式机、云端 Codespace、偶尔的 Linux 服务器。每台设备的环境略有不同：工作机需要公司 VPN 配置和企业 Git 签名，个人机有私人项目的 SSH 密钥，Linux 服务器不需要 GUI 工具。如何用一份 dotfiles 仓库优雅地管理这些差异，是跨设备同步的核心挑战。</p>\n<p>本文深入讲解 GNU Stow 和 chezmoi 两大管理工具的实战用法，重点覆盖条件配置、模板渲染、密钥加密以及与云开发环境的集成方案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"跨设备差异类型\">跨设备差异类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>差异类型</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n<th>处理策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>平台差异</td>\n<td>macOS vs Linux 的路径、包管理器</td>\n<td>条件判断或模板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>身份差异</td>\n<td>工作 Git email vs 个人 email</td>\n<td>Git 条件包含</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具差异</td>\n<td>桌面机有 GUI 工具，服务器没有</td>\n<td>模块化选择性部署</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>密钥差异</td>\n<td>不同机器不同 SSH key</td>\n<td>加密存储或外部引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能差异</td>\n<td>高配机启用更多插件，低配机精简</td>\n<td>条件加载</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"gnu-stow-vs-chezmoi-选型\">GNU Stow vs chezmoi 选型</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;你的需求是什么?&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;多机配置差异大?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;差异很小&quot;| C[&quot;GNU Stow&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;差异显著&quot;| D{&quot;需要密钥管理?&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| E[&quot;chezmoi&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| F{&quot;需要模板渲染?&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| E&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| G[&quot;Stow + 条件 source&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"你的需求是什么?\"] --&gt; B{\"多机配置差异大?\"}\n    B --&gt;|\"差异很小\"| C[\"GNU Stow\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"差异显著\"| D{\"需要密钥管理?\"}\n    D --&gt;|\"是\"| E[\"chezmoi\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"否\"| F{\"需要模板渲染?\"}\n    F --&gt;|\"是\"| E\n    F --&gt;|\"否\"| G[\"Stow + 条件 source\"]</pre><p>简单判断：如果你只有 1-2 台 macOS 机器且差异不大，GNU Stow 足够；如果你管理 3+ 台不同平台/角色的机器，chezmoi 的投入值得。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"gnu-stow-进阶用法\">GNU Stow 进阶用法</h3><h4 id=\"选择性部署\">选择性部署</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"cd ~/dotfiles&#10;&#10;# 所有机器都部署的核心模块&#10;stow zsh git starship&#10;&#10;# 仅桌面机部署 GUI 相关&#10;if [[ &quot;$(uname)&quot; == &quot;Darwin&quot; ]]; then&#10;    stow ghostty aerospace raycast&#10;fi&#10;&#10;# 仅工作机部署&#10;if [[ -f ~/.work-machine ]]; then&#10;    stow work-git work-ssh&#10;fi\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/dotfiles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 所有机器都部署的核心模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stow</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zsh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> starship</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 仅桌面机部署 GUI 相关</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [[ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">uname</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Darwin\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ]]; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    stow</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ghostty</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aerospace</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> raycast</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 仅工作机部署</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [[ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-f</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ~</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">/.work-machine ]]; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    stow</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> work-git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> work-ssh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fi</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"处理冲突\">处理冲突</h4><p>Stow 在目标位置已有文件时会报错。解决方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# --adopt：将现有文件&quot;收养&quot;进仓库（覆盖仓库版本）&#10;stow --adopt zsh&#10;&#10;# 然后用 git diff 检查差异&#10;cd ~/dotfiles &amp;&amp; git diff&#10;&#10;# 确认后提交或回退&#10;git checkout -- .  # 如果想保留仓库版本\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># --adopt：将现有文件\"收养\"进仓库（覆盖仓库版本）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">stow</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --adopt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zsh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 然后用 git diff 检查差异</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/dotfiles</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 确认后提交或回退</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 如果想保留仓库版本</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"stow-的局限性\">Stow 的局限性</h4><ul>\n<li>不支持模板（同一文件不能根据机器生成不同内容）</li>\n<li>不支持文件加密</li>\n<li>不支持 hook 脚本（部署后自动执行命令）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>当遇到这些需求时，升级到 chezmoi。</p>\n<h3 id=\"chezmoi-完整工作流\">chezmoi 完整工作流</h3><h4 id=\"安装与初始化\">安装与初始化</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装&#10;brew install chezmoi&#10;&#10;# 初始化（创建 ~/.local/share/chezmoi 源目录）&#10;chezmoi init&#10;&#10;# 或直接从 GitHub 初始化&#10;chezmoi init https://github.com/username/dotfiles.git\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> chezmoi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 初始化（创建 ~/.local/share/chezmoi 源目录）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chezmoi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或直接从 GitHub 初始化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chezmoi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/username/dotfiles.git</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"基本操作\">基本操作</h4><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 添加文件到管理&#10;chezmoi add ~/.zshrc&#10;chezmoi add ~/.config/starship.toml&#10;chezmoi add --recursive ~/.config/nvim&#10;&#10;# 编辑已管理的文件&#10;chezmoi edit ~/.zshrc&#10;&#10;# 查看变更差异&#10;chezmoi diff&#10;&#10;# 应用变更到 Home 目录&#10;chezmoi apply&#10;&#10;# 更新远程仓库变更&#10;chezmoi update\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 添加文件到管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chezmoi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.zshrc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chezmoi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.config/starship.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chezmoi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --recursive</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.config/nvim</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 编辑已管理的文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chezmoi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> edit</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.zshrc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看变更差异</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chezmoi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 应用变更到 Home 目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chezmoi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apply</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 更新远程仓库变更</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chezmoi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> update</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"模板系统\">模板系统</h4><p>chezmoi 使用 Go template 语法实现条件配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# ~/.local/share/chezmoi/dot_gitconfig.tmpl&#10;&#10;[user]&#10;{{ if eq .chezmoi.hostname &quot;work-macbook&quot; -}}&#10;    name = Zhang San (Work)&#10;    email = zhangsan@company.com&#10;    signingkey = WORK_GPG_KEY&#10;{{ else -}}&#10;    name = Zhang San&#10;    email = zhangsan@gmail.com&#10;    signingkey = PERSONAL_GPG_KEY&#10;{{ end -}}&#10;&#10;[core]&#10;    editor = nvim&#10;    pager = delta&#10;&#10;{{ if eq .chezmoi.os &quot;darwin&quot; -}}&#10;[credential]&#10;    helper = osxkeychain&#10;{{ end -}}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ~/.local/share/chezmoi/dot_gitconfig.tmpl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[user]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{{ if eq .chezmoi.hostname \"work-macbook\" -}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Zhang</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> San</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (Work)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    email</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zhangsan@company.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    signingkey</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> WORK_GPG_KEY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{{ else -}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Zhang</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> San</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    email</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zhangsan@gmail.com</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    signingkey</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> PERSONAL_GPG_KEY</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{{ end -}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[core]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    editor</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> nvim</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    pager</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> delta</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{{ if eq .chezmoi.os \"darwin\" -}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[credential]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    helper</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> osxkeychain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{{ end -}}</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"数据文件\">数据文件</h4><p>在 <code>~/.config/chezmoi/chezmoi.toml</code> 中定义机器特有数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# ~/.config/chezmoi/chezmoi.toml&#10;&#10;[data]&#10;    name = &quot;Zhang San&quot;&#10;    email = &quot;zhangsan@gmail.com&quot;&#10;    machine_type = &quot;personal&quot;  # &quot;work&quot; or &quot;personal&quot;&#10;&#10;[data.work]&#10;    email = &quot;zhangsan@company.com&quot;&#10;    proxy = &quot;http://proxy.company.com:8080&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># ~/.config/chezmoi/chezmoi.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[data]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name = \"Zhang San\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    email = \"zhangsan@gmail.com\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    machine_type = \"personal\"  # \"work\" or \"personal\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[data.work]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    email = \"zhangsan@company.com\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    proxy = \"http://proxy.company.com:8080\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在模板中使用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# dot_zshrc.tmpl&#10;&#10;{{ if eq .machine_type &quot;work&quot; -}}&#10;export HTTP_PROXY=&quot;{{ .work.proxy }}&quot;&#10;export HTTPS_PROXY=&quot;{{ .work.proxy }}&quot;&#10;{{ end -}}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># dot_zshrc.tmpl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{{ if eq .machine_type \"work\" -}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HTTP_PROXY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{{ .work.proxy }}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HTTPS_PROXY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{{ .work.proxy }}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{{ end -}}</span></span></code></pre></div><h4 id=\"密钥加密集成\">密钥加密集成</h4><p>chezmoi 支持多种密钥管理后端：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"# ~/.config/chezmoi/chezmoi.toml&#10;&#10;# 使用 1Password&#10;[onepassword]&#10;    command = &quot;op&quot;&#10;&#10;# 或使用 age 加密&#10;[age]&#10;    identity = &quot;~/.config/chezmoi/key.txt&quot;&#10;    recipient = &quot;age1xxxxxxxxx&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># ~/.config/chezmoi/chezmoi.toml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 使用 1Password</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[onepassword]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    command = \"op\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 或使用 age 加密</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[age]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    identity = \"~/.config/chezmoi/key.txt\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    recipient = \"age1xxxxxxxxx\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在模板中引用 1Password 中的密钥：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# dot_env_secrets.tmpl&#10;export GITHUB_TOKEN=&quot;{{ onepasswordRead &quot;op://Personal/GitHub Token/credential&quot; }}&quot;&#10;export OPENAI_API_KEY=&quot;{{ onepasswordRead &quot;op://Personal/OpenAI/api key&quot; }}&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># dot_env_secrets.tmpl</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GITHUB_TOKEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{{ onepasswordRead \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">op://Personal/GitHub Token/credential</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\" }}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> OPENAI_API_KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{{ onepasswordRead \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">op://Personal/OpenAI/api key</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\" }}\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>加密特定文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 加密整个文件（源文件会带 encrypted_ 前缀）&#10;chezmoi add --encrypt ~/.ssh/config\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 加密整个文件（源文件会带 encrypted_ 前缀）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chezmoi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --encrypt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.ssh/config</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"与-github-codespaces-集成\">与 GitHub Codespaces 集成</h3><p>GitHub Codespaces 原生支持 dotfiles 仓库自动部署：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>在 GitHub Settings &gt; Codespaces &gt; Dotfiles 中指定你的仓库</li>\n<li>Codespace 创建时自动 clone 并执行 <code>install.sh</code>（如果存在）</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# ~/dotfiles/install.sh（Codespace 自动执行）&#10;#!/bin/bash&#10;set -e&#10;&#10;# 检测是否在 Codespace 中&#10;if [ &quot;$CODESPACES&quot; = &quot;true&quot; ]; then&#10;    echo &quot;Running in GitHub Codespaces...&quot;&#10;&#10;    # 安装核心工具&#10;    sudo apt-get update &amp;&amp; sudo apt-get install -y stow&#10;&#10;    # 部署配置（仅 core 模块）&#10;    cd ~/dotfiles&#10;    stow zsh git starship&#10;&#10;    # 安装 Starship&#10;    curl -sS https://starship.rs/install.sh | sh -s -- --yes&#10;fi\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ~/dotfiles/install.sh（Codespace 自动执行）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/bin/bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">set</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检测是否在 Codespace 中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$CODESPACES</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"true\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ]; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Running in GitHub Codespaces...\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 安装核心工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apt-get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26; </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apt-get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -y</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stow</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 部署配置（仅 core 模块）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/dotfiles</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    stow</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> zsh</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> starship</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 安装 Starship</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -sS</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://starship.rs/install.sh</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sh</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --yes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fi</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"迁移到新机器的完整流程\">迁移到新机器的完整流程</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. 在新机器上（使用 chezmoi 方案）&#10;chezmoi init https://github.com/username/dotfiles.git&#10;&#10;# 2. 预览将要应用的变更&#10;chezmoi diff&#10;&#10;# 3. 交互式确认并应用&#10;chezmoi apply&#10;&#10;# 4. 手动验证关键配置&#10;git config user.email  # 确认 Git 身份&#10;echo $PATH             # 确认 PATH 正确\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 在新机器上（使用 chezmoi 方案）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chezmoi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/username/dotfiles.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 预览将要应用的变更</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chezmoi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> diff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 交互式确认并应用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chezmoi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apply</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 4. 手动验证关键配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> user.email</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 确认 Git 身份</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $PATH             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 确认 PATH 正确</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"多机同步工作流\">多机同步工作流</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>在机器 A 修改配置</td>\n<td><code>chezmoi edit ~/.zshrc &amp;&amp; chezmoi apply</code></td>\n<td>编辑并应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提交到远程</td>\n<td><code>chezmoi cd &amp;&amp; git add -A &amp;&amp; git commit &amp;&amp; git push</code></td>\n<td>推送变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>在机器 B 拉取</td>\n<td><code>chezmoi update</code></td>\n<td>拉取并应用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"处理合并冲突\">处理合并冲突</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# chezmoi update 遇到冲突时&#10;chezmoi merge ~/.zshrc  # 打开合并工具&#10;&#10;# 或强制使用远程版本&#10;chezmoi update --force\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># chezmoi update 遇到冲突时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chezmoi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.zshrc</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # 打开合并工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或强制使用远程版本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chezmoi</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> update</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --force</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"安全检查清单\">安全检查清单</h3><ul>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> <code>.chezmoiignore</code> 排除了所有本机生成的文件</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 敏感文件使用 <code>--encrypt</code> 加密或通过密钥管理器引用</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 模板中不硬编码任何 token/password</li>\n<li><input disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"> 定期运行 <code>chezmoi verify</code> 确认源状态和目标一致</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"chezmoi-生态工具\">chezmoi 生态工具</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>chezmoi doctor</code></td>\n<td>诊断环境问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>chezmoi managed</code></td>\n<td>列出所有管理中的文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>chezmoi unmanaged</code></td>\n<td>发现未管理的 dotfiles</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>chezmoi archive</code></td>\n<td>导出为 tar 包（离线部署）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>chezmoi state</code></td>\n<td>查看/修复状态数据库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"密钥管理后端对比\">密钥管理后端对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>后端</th>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1Password CLI</td>\n<td>全平台</td>\n<td>企业级、团队共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bitwarden CLI</td>\n<td>全平台</td>\n<td>开源、自托管可选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>age</td>\n<td>全平台</td>\n<td>简单、文件加密</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gpg</td>\n<td>全平台</td>\n<td>传统、功能全面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>macOS Keychain</td>\n<td>macOS</td>\n<td>系统原生、无额外工具</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>跨设备同步的本质是在&quot;统一性&quot;和&quot;差异化&quot;之间找到平衡。GNU Stow 通过模块化部署解决了&quot;部署什么&quot;的问题，而 chezmoi 通过模板系统解决了&quot;同一文件在不同机器生成不同内容&quot;的问题。对于现代开发者的典型场景（2-3 台设备、偶尔的云环境），chezmoi 配合 1Password CLI 提供了安全、灵活且自动化的完整方案。关键原则是：让仓库成为 single source of truth，让机器差异通过数据驱动的模板来表达，让密钥永远不以明文形式存在于仓库中。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨设备同步与条件配置","id":"跨设备同步与条件配置"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"跨设备差异类型","id":"跨设备差异类型"},{"level":3,"text":"GNU Stow vs chezmoi 选型","id":"gnu-stow-vs-chezmoi-选型"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"GNU Stow 进阶用法","id":"gnu-stow-进阶用法"},{"level":4,"text":"选择性部署","id":"选择性部署"},{"level":4,"text":"处理冲突","id":"处理冲突"},{"level":4,"text":"Stow 的局限性","id":"stow-的局限性"},{"level":3,"text":"chezmoi 完整工作流","id":"chezmoi-完整工作流"},{"level":4,"text":"安装与初始化","id":"安装与初始化"},{"level":4,"text":"基本操作","id":"基本操作"},{"level":4,"text":"模板系统","id":"模板系统"},{"level":4,"text":"数据文件","id":"数据文件"},{"level":4,"text":"密钥加密集成","id":"密钥加密集成"},{"level":3,"text":"与 GitHub Codespaces 集成","id":"与-github-codespaces-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"迁移到新机器的完整流程","id":"迁移到新机器的完整流程"},{"level":3,"text":"多机同步工作流","id":"多机同步工作流"},{"level":3,"text":"处理合并冲突","id":"处理合并冲突"},{"level":3,"text":"安全检查清单","id":"安全检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"chezmoi 生态工具","id":"chezmoi-生态工具"},{"level":3,"text":"密钥管理后端对比","id":"密钥管理后端对比"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"版本控制策略与仓库组织","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/dotfiles-management/version-control-strategy"},"next":{"title":"自动化 Bootstrap 脚本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/dotfiles-management/automated-bootstrap-scripts"}}